# PharmConsilium — corporate website

Website for the **ФармКонсилиум** IT team (pharma marketing, HCP, sales, content, drug reference, portfolio). Audience: pharma brands in **Belarus**. UI and content language — **Russian**.

## Stage
Design prototype; layout and copy are **still being refined**. Preserve architecture and tokens; do not break things for a “perfect” draft.

## Repository structure
```
index.html          — entry point (production)
print.html          — print/PDF (noindex)
css/styles.css      — design tokens and components
assets/             — logo.svg, uploads/
js/core/            — app.jsx, app-print.jsx
js/components/      — header, detail, robot, charts, tweaks
js/pages/           — pages.jsx, portfolio-pages.jsx
js/data/            — subpages-data, portfolio-data, seo-meta.jsx
robots.txt, sitemap.xml
pharmconsilium.html — legacy redirect → index.html
pharmconsilium-print.html — legacy redirect → print.html
```

## Stack
React 18 (UMD) + Babel Standalone in the browser. **No bundler** until a Vite migration is requested.

## Script order in index.html
`tweaks-panel` → `illustrations` → `forecast-chart` → `header-footer` → `pages` → `subpages-data` → `seo-meta` → `detail-page` → `portfolio-data` → `portfolio-pages` → `robot` → `app`.

## Routing
Hash: `marketing`, `hcp`, `marketing/crm`, `portfolio/slug`. Navigation: `navigate(id)`. Subpage content — `window.SUBPAGES`; portfolio — `window.PORTFOLIO`.

## Globals
Do not use `import/export` without a bundler. Illustrations: `window.Art*`. SEO: `window.updatePageSeo(route)` in `js/data/seo-meta.jsx`.

## Copy
Brand name **ФармКонсилиум** in UI. B2B tone, specifics (CRM, CLM, HCP, SoV). CTA: «Получить консультацию» → `team`. Do not invent metrics or legal claims.

## Mobile
The site must stay **responsive and usable on phones** (from **~375px** width upward). After layout or component changes, check narrow viewports: no persistent horizontal overflow, readable type, header/navigation and primary CTAs reachable. Follow existing breakpoints and patterns in `css/styles.css` (see `01-frontend.mdc`).

## Do not do without explicit request
Mass refactor to TS/Vite; duplicating `MEGA`/`SUBPAGES` in JSX; removing `TweaksPanel` and `/*EDITMODE-BEGIN*/`; hardcoded colors instead of CSS variables.
